  "title": "Reasons for Selection",
  "content_html": "<main class=\"p-page\">\n        <div class=\"l-container-fluid\">\n        <ul class=\"c-breadcrumb\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/BreadcrumbList\"><li class=\"c-breadcrumb__item\" itemprop=\"itemListElement\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ListItem\"><a itemprop=\"item\" href=\"https://rebooth.co.jp\"><span itemprop=\"name\" >HOME</span></a><meta itemprop=\"position\" content=\"1\" /></li><li class=\"c-breadcrumb__item\" itemprop=\"itemListElement\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ListItem\"><span itemprop=\"name\">Reasons for Selection</span><meta itemprop=\"position\" content=\"2\" /></li></ul>      </div>\n      <section class=\"p-page__header\">\n        <div class=\"l-container-fluid\">\n          <div class=\"p-page__title c-title-sec \">\n            <p class=\"c-text--en js-split\">\n              why choose us            </p>\n            <h1 class=\"c-text--ja p-page__title--fade\">Reasons for Selection</h1>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n                      </section>  <div class=\"wp_block-content\">\n    \n<div class=\"wp-block-cover alignfull p-page__thumbnail g-thumbnail\" style=\"margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--xxl)\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-text-background-color has-background-dim-60 has-background-dim\"></span><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1081\" src=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/choose.jpg\" class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" data-object-fit=\"cover\" srcset=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/choose.jpg 1920w, https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/choose-960x541.jpg 960w, https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/choose-450x253.jpg 450w, https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/choose-768x432.jpg 768w, https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/choose-1536x865.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" /><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container is-layout-constrained wp-block-cover-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>Exhibition booths that achieve both design appeal and reusability</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-custom-css wp-custom-css-a64bd35d wp-block-paragraph\">Re:Booth (Re:ブース) leverages a high degree of design freedom while<br>being an exhibition booth designed for easy reuse in subsequent exhibitions.</p>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group pa-column-full alignfull is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group pa-column-full__img is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full u-media g-mask-to-start\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" src=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/choose.2.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-489\" srcset=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/choose.2.jpg 1920w, https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/choose.2-960x540.jpg 960w, https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/choose.2-450x253.jpg 450w, https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/choose.2-768x432.jpg 768w, https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/choose.2-1536x864.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" /></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group pa-column-full__body l-container-fluid is-content-justification-left is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-0f3c7894 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading is-decorated-top\">Uncompromising Design</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">&quot;Reusable booths lack design appeal&quot; —<br>Re:Booth overturns this conventional wisdom.<br>By combining a truss structure with in-house design, we freely shape a company's worldview and product appeal, which are difficult to express with standardized prefabricated booths. We design memorable booths tailored to the exhibited content and brand image.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-default has-arrow-next is-decorated has-arrow-next\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/why-choose-us/design-quality/\">read more</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group pa-column-full alignfull is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group pa-column-full__img is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-medium u-media g-mask-to-end\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"960\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/choose.3-960x640.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-494\" srcset=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/choose.3-960x640.jpg 960w, https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/choose.3-450x300.jpg 450w, https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/choose.3-768x512.jpg 768w, https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/choose.3-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/choose.3.jpg 1620w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\" /></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group pa-column-full__body l-container-fluid is-content-justification-left is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-0f3c7894 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading is-decorated-top\"><strong><strong>Design Based on Reuse</strong>Strength</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">From the initial design stage, the booth is designed with a structure and specifications that are easy to use in subsequent exhibitions. After use, it is stored in the company's own warehouse and reassembled for the next exhibition.<br>Because it is not designed for disposal, the environmental burden is reduced with each repeated exhibition.<br>When used 10 times, it achieves up to 64% CO2 reduction compared to conventional booths.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-default has-arrow-next is-decorated has-arrow-next\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/why-choose-us/reuse/\">read more</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group pa-column-full alignfull is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group pa-column-full__img is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-medium u-media g-mask-to-start\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" src=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/640788444-960x540.jpeg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-500\" srcset=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/640788444-960x540.jpeg 960w, https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/640788444-1920x1081.jpeg 1920w, https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/640788444-450x253.jpeg 450w, https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/640788444-768x432.jpeg 768w, https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/640788444-1536x864.jpeg 1536w, https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/640788444-2048x1153.jpeg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\" /></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group pa-column-full__body l-container-fluid is-content-justification-left is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-0f3c7894 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading is-decorated-top\"><strong><strong>Balancing Exhibition Costs and Environmental Impact</strong></strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">By repeatedly using the same booth, the cost of re-fabrication for each exhibition is significantly compressed.<br>The cost of a typical booth is from 1,500,000 yen, and it is essentially a single-use, disposable item. In contrast, for Re:Booth, while the initial cost is similar, from the second use onward, the cost is 40% off the initial cost due to the reuse of the stored booth.<br>From both cost and environmental perspectives, we support sustainable exhibition participation.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-default has-arrow-next is-decorated has-arrow-next\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/why-choose-us/reduces-costs/\">read more</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n  </div>\n  </div>\n</main>",
